DESCRIPTION:In this talk I present some lesser known gotchas and implicit b
 ehaviors of Foreign Keys in Django. We'll talk about what you need to pay 
 attention to when defining FKs\, how to change FKs without bringing your s
 ystem to a halt and how to optimize for space\, performance and heavy load
 .
